            <note corresp="#d93-f2" n="8" xml:id="d93-f2-content">
                <p>For texts of agreements with Cuba, November 7, 1941; Dominican Republic, August 2
                    and August 6, 1941; Haiti, September 16, 1941; Nicaragua, October 16, 1941; and
                    Paraguay, September 20, 1941; see <ref target="frus1941v07#pg_122">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1941, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">vii</hi>, pp. 122</ref>, <ref
                        target="frus1941v07#pg_253">253</ref>, <ref target="frus1941v07#pg_319"
                        >319</ref>, <ref target="frus1941v07#pg_410">410</ref>, and <ref
                        target="frus1941v07#pg_480">480</ref>. respectively.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
